#: includes/class-msc-scheduled-visibility-settings.php:85
msgid "WooCommerce"
msgstr "WooCommerce"

#: includes/class-msc-scheduled-visibility-settings.php:88
#: includes/class-msc-scheduled-visibility-settings.php:486
#: includes/class-msc-scheduled-visibility-settings.php:558
msgid "Advanced"
